## 9. TLS / HTTPS

The app only starts an HTTP server. In production you must terminate TLS either in a reverse proxy (NGINX, Envoy, Cloud‑load‑balancer) **or** via `https.createServer`. Document that the service must be run behind a secure endpoint.

